<article class="env-remark" id="0EBQ">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0EBQ">Remark <span data-tag="0EBQ">31.30.5</span>.</a> Let $A$ be a Noetherian normal domain. Let $M$ be a rank $1$ finite reflexive $A$-module. Let $s \in M$ be nonzero. Let $\mathfrak p_1, \ldots , \mathfrak p_ r$ be the height $1$ primes of $A$ in the support of $M/As$. Then the open $U$ of Lemma <a href="/tag/0EBN" data-tag="0EBN">31.30.3</a> is </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  U = \mathop{\mathrm{Spec}}(A) \setminus \left(V(\mathfrak p_1) \cup \ldots \cup V(\mathfrak p_ r)\right)  \]
</div>
  <p> by Lemma <a href="/tag/0EBP" data-tag="0EBP">31.30.4</a>. Moreover, if $M^{[n]}$ denotes the reflexive hull of $M \otimes _ A \ldots \otimes _ A M$ ($n$-factors), then </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \Gamma (U, \mathcal{O}_ U) = \mathop{\mathrm{colim}}\nolimits M^{[n]}  \]
</div>
  <p> according to Lemma <a href="/tag/0EBN" data-tag="0EBN">31.30.3</a>. </p>
</article>